otte LinlinDialogue: 0,0:01:51.08,0:01:53.74,Narrator,,0,0,0,,where Emperor Big Mom is.Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.13,0:02:00.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about Pekoms. We gotta look for him!Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.66,0:02:05.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, but that won't be easy. He's a tough man, so he'll be okay.Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.14,0:02:07.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.48,0:02:11.19,Main,,0,0,0,,At any rate, we need to get to Whole Cake IslandDialogue: 0,0:02:11.19,0:02:13.07,Main,,0,0,0,,without being seen by the enemy.Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.07,0:02:15.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are we now?Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.82,0:02:22.78,Main,,0,0,0,,We haven't gone far from Cacao Island yet.Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.50,0:02:28.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, I see an island!Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.63,0:02:32.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Yay! What kind of snack will be there?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.84,0:02:36.05,Main,,0,0,0,,I can tell from the smell! It must be something sweet!Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.05,0:02:39.38,Main,,0,0,0,,The next one is probably a town made of jam.Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.38,0:02:41.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Jam?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.08,0:02:42.69,Main,,0,0,0,,We're not gonna stop there though.Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.69,0:02:44.02,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.02,0:02:46.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Here, look.Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.10,0:02:47.82,Main,,0,0,0,,When we spot Jam Island,Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.82,0:02:51.35,Main,,0,0,0,,instead of approaching it, we turn in the direction of the second Log Pose.Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.35,0:02:54.72,Main,,0,0,0,,But it's sweet! Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.72,0:02:58.19,Main,,0,0,0,,We're not gonna go there even though it's sweet?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.49,0:02:59.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's see...Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.40,0:03:01.96,Main,,0,0,0,,That way.Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.96,0:03:03.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.87,0:03:08.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, starboard! In the direction of three o' clock!Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.26,0:03:12.43,Note,,0,0,0,,Sanji translates to Three O' Clock.Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.26,0:03:12.43,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! Chopper! Carrot! We're going in the direction of Sanji! Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.43,0:03:14.05,Main,,0,0,0,,But it's sweet!Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.45,0:03:18.27,Main,,0,0,0,,We're gonna go pick up Sanji! Hard a starboard!Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.27,0:03:19.55,Main,,0,0,0,,That's too much!Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.55,0:03:21.89,Main,,0,0,0,,You're bad at this, Luffy-san!Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.89,0:03:23.77,Main,,0,0,0,,You too, Brook!Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.77,0:03:26.57,Main,,0,0,0,,But it's sweet...Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.57,0:03:30.94,Main,,0,0,0,,By turning towards the next island before getting too close to another one,Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.94,0:03:34.48,Main,,0,0,0,,we can avoid their surveillance network, she said.Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.48,0:03:38.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, so that's how you read the map.Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.41,0:03:39.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Can you do it?Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.70,0:03:40.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Count on me.Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.87,0:03:44.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san, I'll take it from here.Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.13,0:03:45.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.16,0:03:48.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, guys, I'll cook something for you!Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.12,0:03:48.81,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.34,0:03:51.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I gotta cook!Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.21,0:03:52.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Please!Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.17,0:03:54.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, wait a second!Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.50,0:03:56.54,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you want, Nami? I'll cook.Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.54,0:03:57.34,Main,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.78,0:03:59.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna mess up this time!Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.92,0:04:04.39,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll do it! Don't you ever set foot in the kitchen again!Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.39,0:04:06.31,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not paying you one dime!Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.31,0:04:07.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't need your money!Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.48,0:04:09.02,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.86,0:04:15.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Can I look, Pedro? I wanna help!Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.82,0:04:16.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.35,0:04:21.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's see...Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.36,0:04:26.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! The water is grape-colored!Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.50,0:04:29.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Grape?Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.33,0:04:32.12,Main,,0,0,0,,There is an island that spills juice around here.Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.12,0:04:33.30,Main,,0,0,0,,It's no harm to us.Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.30,0:04:36.23,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Is that juice?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.23,0:04:38.17,Main,,0,0,0,,This place is such a paradise!Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.86,0:04:41.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Pedro, how do you know so much about this area?Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.18,0:04:47.14,Main,,0,0,0,,I've been here once before.Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.14,0:04:48.18,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.49,0:04:56.38,Main,,0,0,0,,It's gigantic!Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.65,0:05:00.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Wow! It's big!Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.33,0:05:05.28,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a Giant Sea Centipede. They reside in this area.Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.57,0:05:09.81,Main,,0,0,0,,No! Giant Sea Centipede, go away!Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.81,0:05:11.29,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll be eaten!Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.29,0:05:13.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, this is your job!Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.63,0:05:14.83,Main,,0,0,0,,All right!Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.84,0:05:20.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll do what little I can too!Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.93,0:05:28.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Here it comes!Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.79,0:05:31.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.72,0:05:34.03,Main,,0,0,0,,... Gatling!Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.81,0:05:51.70,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, on Whole Cake Island...Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.12,0:05:54.62,Captions,,0,0,0,,Whole Cake IslandDialogue: 0,0:05:51.70,0:05:54.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Croquembouche!Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.82,0:06:01.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama! Stop! Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.80,0:06:09.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama... Mama, please stop!Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.28,0:06:10.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Move!Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.05,0:06:13.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Croquembouche!Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.56,0:06:18.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh no! It's Mama's illness!Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.04,0:06:22.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up-bon! What does she want this time-soir?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.72,0:06:23.57,Main,,0,0,0,,She wants...Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.75,0:06:26.82,Main,,0,0,0,,... croquembouche!Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.82,0:06:28.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Croquembouche?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.84,0:06:32.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that the decorated dessert that is composed of cream puffs piled up?Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.54,0:06:35.09,Main,,0,0,0,,This will be a challenge.Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.09,0:06:37.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! No, wait!Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.33,0:06:39.84,Main,,0,0,0,,I think there is a tourist group of...Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.84,0:06:44.00,Main,,0,0,0,,... cream puffs staying at a hotel in the city-je-t'aime!Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.00,0:06:46.01,Main,,0,0,0,,They already checked out this morning.Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.01,0:06:49.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Should we just make one? What does the chef say?Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.30,0:06:53.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to make the dough special. Could you get me almonds?Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.74,0:06:56.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll tell the Minister of Nuts!Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.60,0:06:59.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama is heading towards Sweet City now!Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.60,0:07:04.10,Main,,0,0,0,,She's coming this way?! This is the capital! Mama's castle is here!Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.10,0:07:08.64,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't talk her out of it! She's losing her mind from the attack!Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.02,0:07:14.11,Main,,0,0,0,,The death toll is still rising!Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.11,0:07:17.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Issue an evacuation order in Sweet City!Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.44,0:07:21.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Only a croquembouche can stop Mama now!Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.46,0:07:24.62,Main,,0,0,0,,This way! Hurry up and evacuate! Hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.17,0:07:28.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama, please stop!Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.38,0:07:31.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama, let's not do this!Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.59,0:07:36.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Bring me croquembouche!Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.06,0:07:42.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama entered Sweet City! She entered Sweet City!Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.85,0:07:45.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, she's finally here...Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.19,0:07:49.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama's Hunger Pangs are very troublesome-bon!Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.47,0:07:52.24,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't know when the attack will strike.Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.24,0:07:57.06,Main,,0,0,0,,The destruction continues until she gets a bite of what she craves.Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.06,0:07:58.87,Main,,0,0,0,,It's worse than any kind of disaster.Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.87,0:08:02.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, evacuate all the residents!Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.04,0:08:03.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Run! Hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.93,0:08:05.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom's having a tantrum!Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.88,0:08:08.80,Main,,0,0,0,,– Stop! – Not in this city!Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.64,0:08:18.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama! Mama! Not in this city!Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.47,0:08:23.02,Main,,0,0,0,,– She'll destroy her own castle! – It's no good. She can't hear us.Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.15,0:08:37.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Croquembouche!Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.54,0:08:45.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Croquembouche!Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.96,0:08:54.22,Main,,0,0,0,,This isn't it!Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.76,0:08:57.76,Main,,0,0,0,,L-Look up!Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.90,0:09:15.72,Main,,0,0,0,,This isn't the taste!Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.72,0:09:18.54,Main,,0,0,0,,You losers aren't it either!Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.54,0:09:21.29,Main,,0,0,0,,It's all wrong!Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.33,0:09:27.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Croquembouche!Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.13,0:09:30.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.89,0:09:34.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Moscato-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.51,0:09:37.98,Main,,0,0,0,,The 16th son of the Charlotte Family and the Minister of Gelato!Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.98,0:09:41.51,Main,,0,0,0,,He's a member of Mama's family! I'm sure he can stop her!Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.51,0:09:46.02,Main,,0,0,0,,This is Moscato! How's the croquembouche?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.50,0:09:46.02,Captions,,0,0,0,,Charlotte Moscato The 16th Son of the Charlotte Family The Minister of GelatoDialogue: 0,0:09:46.02,0:09:50.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard it'll take half an hour or so to be ready-bon!Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.58,0:09:55.36,Main,,0,0,0,,It'll be too late by then! We can't let her destroy the castle!Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.70,0:10:01.49,Main,,0,0,0,,This isn't it!Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.33,0:10:05.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama! Stop it!Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.44,0:10:07.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Who is that?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.29,0:10:14.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama! It's me! Moscato!Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.99,0:10:23.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Where is my croquembouche?Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.54,0:10:26.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Croquembouche...Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.52,0:10:28.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Croquembouche!Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.98,0:10:34.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Give us 30 minutes! The chefs are trying to make it as quickly as they can!Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.65,0:10:38.70,Main,,0,0,0,,No, Big Bro Mos! It's impossible to stop her!Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.70,0:10:41.49,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't let her ruin the capital!Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.55,0:10:45.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Move out of my way!Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.71,0:10:52.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you recognize me, Mama?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.64,0:11:06.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Life...Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.93,0:11:07.60,Main,,0,0,0,,...or...Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.61,0:11:11.35,Main,,0,0,0,,... treat!Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.94,0:11:20.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Life or treat...Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.20,0:11:22.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Lifespan or snack!Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.36,0:11:26.24,Main,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding, Mama! He's your own son!Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.24,0:11:28.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama, don't do it!Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.30,0:11:34.25,Main,,0,0,0,,W-We have whipped cream here-fa! No dough yet but Mama, don't!Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.94,0:11:37.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-The treat is not here yet!Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.55,0:11:40.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll take the treat...Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.62,0:11:43.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't get in my way!Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.65,0:12:00.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.19,0:12:02.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Moscato, stay cool!Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.99,0:12:09.50,Main,,0,0,0,,No-fa! Any sign of fear and your lifespan will be taken away!Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.82,0:12:21.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Have mercy, Mama! I won't stop you anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.22,0:12:24.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Just please! Don't kill me!Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.01,0:12:44.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Give me 40 years.Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.04,0:12:52.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Bro!Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.02,0:12:56.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Moscato-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.03,0:12:57.83,Main,,0,0,0,,She killed...Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.92,0:13:02.32,Main,,0,0,0,,... her own son!!Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.42,0:13:09.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Croquembouche!Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.67,0:13:13.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Run! No one can stop her now!Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.48,0:13:21.27,Main,,0,0,0,,That's terrible.Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.16,0:13:31.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Somebody's coming from the river of juice!Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.08,0:13:33.33,Main,,0,0,0,,– That's... – That man is...Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.33,0:13:34.75,Main,,0,0,0,,No doubt!Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.75,0:13:37.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone, move!Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.04,0:13:40.54,Captions,,0,0,0,,Jinbe – The Former Warlord The Captain of the Sun PiratesDialogue: 0,0:13:37.83,0:13:40.54,Main,,0,0,0,,It's Boss Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.13,0:13:43.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Help!Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.21,0:13:45.51,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll be eaten!Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.18,0:13:48.85,Main,,0,0,0,,He has a croquembouche on his side!Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.85,0:13:52.64,Main,,0,0,0,,He caught those tourist cream puffs for us!Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.64,0:13:57.23,Main,,0,0,0,,They are coated with candy! Did the Minister of Candy do it?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.56,0:14:04.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Look over here!Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.32,0:14:07.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't get in my way!Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.99,0:14:11.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Catch this!Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.68,0:14:38.39,Main,,0,0,0,,It's delicious!Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.01,0:14:43.65,Main,,0,0,0,,– Yeah! – Mama has cooled down!Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.98,0:14:47.28,Main,,0,0,0,,This is it!Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.81,0:14:52.13,Main,,0,0,0,,If it's delicious, that's all that matters...Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.13,0:14:55.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Boss Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.95,0:15:00.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Let the chefs know! The crisis is over!Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.08,0:15:02.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Summon all the ministers!Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.44,0:15:06.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Restore the capital as rapidly as possible-bon!Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.80,0:15:14.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh my loyal knight of the sea, Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.35,0:15:19.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Good job bringing me the Poneglyph the other day.Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.68,0:15:23.36,Captions,,0,0,0,,Charlotte Linlin – One of the Four Emperors The Queen of Totto Land The Captain of the Big Mom PiratesDialogue: 0,0:15:19.06,0:15:21.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't read it though.Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.86,0:15:31.39,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you want today? Why are we out here?Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.82,0:15:36.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh? The city is looking better than ever.Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.33,0:15:38.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you do this?Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.58,0:15:44.00,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I just arrived, and I have no clue what happened, ma'am.Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.00,0:15:46.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh...Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.42,0:15:48.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm here...Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.22,0:15:54.72,Main,,0,0,0,,... to tell you something important today.Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.89,0:16:04.65,Main,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna leave my crew, are you?Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.32,0:16:10.32,Captions,,0,0,0,,A Few Hours AgoDialogue: 0,0:16:12.04,0:16:17.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy will change the world someday!Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.00,0:16:21.97,Main,,0,0,0,,I know he is still young, but I don't think any one of theDialogue: 0,0:16:21.97,0:16:24.71,Main,,0,0,0,,current Four Emperors will become the king of the sea!Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.22,0:16:29.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I think Straw Hat Luffy will be the one!Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.98,0:16:33.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I...Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.97,0:16:38.31,Main,,0,0,0,,... want to be of help to him!Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.32,0:16:46.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm too...Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.70,0:16:48.86,Main,,0,0,0,,... weak!!Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.86,0:16:54.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I... I want to get on board his ship...Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.50,0:16:57.82,Main,,0,0,0,,... and dedicate my life to him!Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.82,0:17:04.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I believe that journey will bring true freedom to the Fishmen in the end!Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.71,0:17:13.47,Captions,,0,0,0,,Aladine (A Brotula Merman) The First Mate of the Sun PiratesDialogue: 0,0:17:08.26,0:17:14.30,Main,,0,0,0,,For the last two years, you told us a lot about Luffy-kun.Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.80,0:17:19.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking you should go join him if you like him so much.Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.86,0:17:22.68,Main,,0,0,0,,D-Did I really?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.28,0:17:25.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Did I talk about him so much?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.25,0:17:30.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Go, Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.59,0:17:35.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.07,0:17:40.74,Main,,0,0,0,,No one here has the right to object, Captain!Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.74,0:17:46.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! You were a soldier of the Neptune Army, but you became a pirate...Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.60,0:17:51.67,Main,,0,0,0,,... to fight with us, the former slaves who fled from Mariejois!Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.67,0:17:57.04,Main,,0,0,0,,You became a Warlord to help advance the social status of us Fishmen!Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.04,0:18:01.57,Main,,0,0,0,,And you allied with the Big Mom PiratesDialogue: 0,0:18:01.57,0:18:07.98,Main,,0,0,0,,to protect us and our home, Ryugu Kingdom, under Big Mom's name.Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.98,0:18:13.71,Main,,0,0,0,,You've always made choices for the sake of others!Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.28,0:18:18.21,Main,,0,0,0,,You did enough, Jinbe.Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.83,0:18:24.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Be free, Jinbe-san!Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.29,0:18:28.38,Main,,0,0,0,,– Go, Jinbe! – Yeah, Captain Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.38,0:18:32.21,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll be fine without you. Don't underestimate us!Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.21,0:18:36.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Live for yourself from now on!Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.15,0:18:55.36,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys... Thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.85,0:19:12.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Having said that, I don't think Big Mom will let Captain go so easily...Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.00,0:19:17.61,Main,,0,0,0,,If she gets mad at us too, all we can do is run!Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.61,0:19:20.34,Main,,0,0,0,,But what about Aladine-san?Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.12,0:19:25.87,Main,,0,0,0,,He got married to Madam Praline and became a member of Big Mom's family.Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.87,0:19:27.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh?Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.66,0:19:32.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you guys worried about me?Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.81,0:19:34.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Madam!Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.86,0:19:39.24,Captions,,0,0,0,,Charlotte Praline (Half-Human, Half-Hammerhead Shark Mermaid) The 29th Daughter of the Charlotte FamilyDialogue: 0,0:19:39.24,0:19:42.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you talking behind my back?Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.45,0:19:44.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you hear what we said?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.99,0:19:49.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you trying to hide something from me?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.98,0:19:56.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Aladine! Don't tell me you were gonna leave me behind if Mama gets angry!Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.26,0:19:58.63,Main,,0,0,0,,No, of course, I'd ask you...Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.63,0:20:01.09,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't need to ask!Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.09,0:20:07.14,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll definitely choose you over Mama! If anything happens, take me with you!Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.14,0:20:09.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, so passionate!Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.13,0:20:13.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Wadatsumi.Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.08,0:20:16.09,Main,,0,0,0,,I just brought you here, but as you heard, I've got to go.Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.09,0:20:21.70,Main,,0,0,0,,That's okay! I'm so happy to be with these guys.Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.51,0:20:31.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, Praline, do you think Mama won't forgive me... I mean, us?Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.50,0:20:38.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, there were precedents, but those who wished to leave her crew...Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.87,0:20:40.71,Main,,0,0,0,,... are all dead.Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.10,0:20:46.06,Captions,,1000,0,240,,The Present: Whole Cake IslandDialogue: 0,0:20:46.34,0:20:50.47,Captions,,0,0,0,,Sweet City The Capital of Whole Cake IslandDialogue: 0,0:21:05.07,0:21:07.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Moscato-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.32,0:21:10.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Moscato-sama is dead!Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.66,0:21:13.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't die, Moscato-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.62,0:21:16.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Moscato-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.34,0:21:25.22,Main,,0,0,0,,They're finally here.Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.53,0:21:34.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and take him away.Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.00,0:21:34.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.60,0:21:36.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Step back.Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.12,0:21:48.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen, guys.Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.32,0:21:52.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Every last second. Okay?Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.21,0:22:03.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Moscato-sama...Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.67,0:22:11.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Say, do you think Boss Jinbe will be killed too, Mont d'Or-sama?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.28,0:22:12.98,Main,,0,0,0,,How should I know?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.98,0:22:16.92,Main,,0,0,0,,When someone makes Mama angry, this is surely what happens,Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.92,0:22:18.52,Main,,0,0,0,,even if it's her own son!Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.30,0:22:28.58,Captions,,10,0,420,,Sweet City Whole Cake ChateauDialogue: 0,0:22:29.68,0:22:32.74,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess you're leaving, Jinbe.Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.56,0:22:39.34,Main,,0,0,0,,– Why, Boss?! – Don't leave, Boss! Why do you have to leave?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.34,0:22:40.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.88,0:22:51.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't ask someone why they're leaving! That's pathetic!Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.60,0:22:54.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Who cares?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.46,0:23:02.52,Main,,0,0,0,,If you're a pirate, of course you want to live as you like.Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.01,0:23:05.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Am I delicious? Tell me, am I...Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.22,0:23:10.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Having said that,Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.14,0:23:15.90,Main,,0,0,0,,having a pledge of loyalty reneged brings shame to a lord.Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.88,0:23:23.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe, you know this means I'm going to lose a powerful asset – you.Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.11,0:23:24.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, but...Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.92,0:23:30.49,Main,,0,0,0,,No "but"! You should lose something too!Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.49,0:23:33.09,Main,,0,0,0,,You have to pay a price!Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.63,0:23:41.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Bring me the roulette!Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.50,0:23:42.81,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.60,0:24:00.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, spin it.Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.00,0:24:11.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see what you're gonna lose!Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.18,0:24:23.27,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Luffy and the others are on the water in Big Mom's territory.Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.92,0:24:27.52,Main,,0,0,0,,So sweet!Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.89,0:24:31.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, it's not moving a bit.Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.34,0:24:32.63,Main,,0,0,0,,No...Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.63,0:24:35.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, let's just stay here and sleep!Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.43,0:24:39.29,Main,,0,0,0,,No! What if those ants attack us again?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.29,0:24:43.16,Main,,0,0,0,,When the sun rises, it'll begin to flow again.Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.16,0:24:46.44,Main,,0,0,0,,But during the night, it gets cold and solidifies.Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.44,0:24:49.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Share those things beforehand!Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.96,0:24:55.11,Main,,0,0,0,,We've gotta melt it and get out of this area of starch syrup!Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.11,0:24:55.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.45,0:24:57.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Pull it!Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.95,0:25:01.60,Main,,0,0,0,,We just put the army of ants to sleep!Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.60,0:25:04.15,Main,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be trouble when they wake up.Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.15,0:25:05.85,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right.Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.77,0:25:12.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Those Sea Ants once ate my ship.Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.55,0:25:13.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh my!Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.53,0:25:17.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Once? What did you come here for?Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.66,0:25:22.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Pedro used to be a pirate along with Pekoms.Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.15,0:25:24.68,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Really?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.20,0:25:27.70,Main,,0,0,0,,I was so naive.Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.70,0:25:31.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought of myself as an explorer, but I became a wanted person.Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.96,0:25:34.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I only accompanied Pekoms halfway.Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.68,0:25:39.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I trust you-gara people, so I can tell you.Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.60,0:25:45.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I was looking for Poneglyphs because I wanted to help Master Cat Viper.Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.19,0:25:53.53,Main,,0,0,0,,But when I trespassed in Big Mom's territory, it became my last voyage.Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.22,0:25:57.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I...Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.45,0:26:00.36,Main,,0,0,0,,... was defeated here once.Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.03,0:26:09.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I've seldom told anyone about this.Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.96,0:26:12.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't know that.Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.30,0:26:23.77,Main,,0,0,0,,You have bad memories, yet came back?Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.77,0:26:29.19,Main,,0,0,0,,If my experience helps you even a little bit to take back Sanji, I'll be happy.Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.61,0:26:32.61,Main,,0,0,0,,On top of that,Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.61,0:26:36.48,Main,,0,0,0,,maybe it wasn't so bad that I came along.Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.54,0:26:43.20,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard our kings showed you-gara people the Road Poneglyph at the Whale Tree.Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.20,0:26:44.74,Main,,0,0,0,,They did.Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.74,0:26:47.31,Main,,0,0,0,,I was surprised.Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.79,0:26:49.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Even though you may have saved us,Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.64,0:26:53.17,Main,,0,0,0,,they haven't shown it to anybody other than the Kozuki Clan...Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.17,0:26:56.13,Main,,0,0,0,,... for 26 years...Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.13,0:26:59.84,Main,,0,0,0,,... since they showed it to Gol D. Roger's pirate group.Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.56,0:27:01.93,Main,,0,0,0,,The Pirate King?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.36,0:27:07.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Later, Roger reached Raftel and was called the Pirate King.Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.64,0:27:16.11,Main,,0,0,0,,You-gara people remind Duke Dogstorm and Master Cat Viper of them.Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.61,0:27:23.57,Main,,0,0,0,,They're expecting you to become somebody who'll need the Road Poneglyphs.Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.99,0:27:27.26,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do after you defeat Kaidou?Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.70,0:27:30.79,Main,,0,0,0,,That's too far ahead! I haven't thought about it...Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.79,0:27:34.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Next, you'll need the Road Poneglyph that Big Mom has!Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.81,0:27:39.48,Main,,0,0,0,,If so, this would be our biggest chance!Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.48,0:27:42.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Since we came this deep into her territory,Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.55,0:27:48.14,Main,,0,0,0,,we'd better steal Big Mom's Road Poneglyph in addition to taking back Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.39,0:27:53.79,Main,,0,0,0,,What? But that's...Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.82,0:27:57.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Not just Sanji, but also a Road Poneglyph?Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.37,0:28:05.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, Robin asked me to get it too, but I wanna rescue Sanji first...Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.42,0:28:07.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I know.Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.16,0:28:11.89,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll get the Road Poneglyph. You-gara guys go for Sanji.Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.89,0:28:12.87,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.63,0:28:18.77,Main,,0,0,0,,When we reach the island, could I have a little time?Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.77,0:28:20.47,Main,,0,0,0,,This time, I'll get it!Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.47,0:28:24.59,Main,,0,0,0,,No, but if you're doing it for us, we'll come with you!Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.59,0:28:28.14,Main,,0,0,0,,No, you make sure to protect Sanji.Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.14,0:28:30.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Even after you get him back, things will be tough.Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.69,0:28:38.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay. Then I'll leave it to you!Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.36,0:28:41.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Great!Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.00,0:28:42.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't decide so easily...Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.52,0:28:49.24,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Luffy-san was born to be lucky...Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.78,0:28:51.86,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it, Brook?Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.86,0:28:54.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Nothing. I am lucky too.Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.87,0:28:58.00,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? You're weird.Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.81,0:29:13.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, the ants are awake!Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.84,0:29:15.06,Main,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.06,0:29:17.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Ant! Ant! Ant! Ant!Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.80,0:29:19.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Here they come!Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.15,0:29:22.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Save the Sunny!Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.07,0:29:29.55,Captions,,1000,0,310,,The Next DayDialogue: 0,0:29:34.28,0:29:36.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.30,0:29:37.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Wake up!Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.03,0:29:43.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? What is it?Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.13,0:29:57.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Look! Look!Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.91,0:30:10.53,Main,,0,0,0,,We're here finally!Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.28,0:30:21.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's gigantic!Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.24,0:30:24.14,Main,,0,0,0,,So this is where the Emperor lives!Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.58,0:30:27.51,Main,,0,0,0,,There's a cake!Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.59,0:30:34.51,Main,,0,0,0,,That tallest whole cake is a castle where Big Mom lives.Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.51,0:30:36.15,Main,,0,0,0,,A castle?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.15,0:30:38.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami-san, we'll continue on straight like this?Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.90,0:30:42.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, that cape is the only place without security.Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.85,0:30:44.57,Main,,0,0,0,,I see.Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.57,0:30:47.10,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the place Pudding-san mentioned.Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.10,0:30:50.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we have to really thank her.Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.81,0:30:54.53,Main,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for her, I don't know if we could've make it this far.Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.53,0:30:56.12,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right.Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.41,0:31:00.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, somebody's there!Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.54,0:31:09.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji?Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.93,0:31:13.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that Sanji?! Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.17,0:31:15.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.17,0:31:17.30,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Feeso, Galaxy 9000  Timing: Halee Sewil (Opening)  Quality Assurance: Galaxy 9000, Grug, Mr. Luffy, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi, Yibis (Karaoke)  Translation: Crunchyroll, Yibis (Opening)